{"articleNo":"967","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=967&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"미취업 대졸생 지원 프로그램 (외국어/MOS) 과정 모집안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.11.03","hit":"10571","attachments":[{"name":"미취업 MOS수강신청서.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=967&attachNo=69910"},{"name":"미취업 어학수강신청서1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=967&attachNo=70221"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">미취업 대졸생 지원 프로그램 (외국어/MOS) 과정 모집안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\">외국어교육과정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;1.<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 목표 및 기대성과</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 66pt; TEXT-INDENT: -66pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 변화하는 시대에 발맞추어 기업이 원하는 글로벌 인재양성</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 66pt; TEXT-INDENT: -66pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">모의 Test 후 종료시점에 시험을 응시하여 Test 대비 10% 이상의 점수</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"> 상향을 목표로 함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;2.. 주요내용</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-